":"/anime/4506-library-wars-the-wings-of-revolution","image":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/bx11001-hiWkp5cRDi1n.jpg","type":"Movie","year":"2012","dubStatus":"subbed","dubStatusKey":"Subbed","variants":[{"status":"subbed","statusKey":"Subbed","title":"Library Wars: The Wings of Revolution","link":"/anime/4506-library-wars-the-wings-of-revolution","image":"https://img.animeunity.co/anime/bx11001-hiWkp5cRDi1n.jpg"}]}],"linkList":[{"title":"Episodes 1-12","titleKey":"Episodes {{start}}-{{end}}","titleParams":{"start":1,"end":12},"availabilityStatus":"available","episodesLink":"4504|1|12"}]},"episodes":[{"title":"Episodio 1","episodeNumber":1,"sourceEpisodeNumber":1,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5558","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"mal","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"89742","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81999","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"link":"69719","synopsis":"愛しい本を検閲から守ってくれた“王子様”を追って『関東図書隊』に入隊した、熱血バカ・笠原 郁（170cm）。鬼教官・堂上（165cm）の厳しい軍事訓練が続くある日、市街哨戒へ出た郁はメディア良化隊の検閲に遭遇する！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yE0L4ZwELUq6vOet8A1MCQbKQuT.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5558","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"89742","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81999","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"69720","synopsis":"ライバル・手塚とともに“ライブラリータスクフォース”に配属された郁。野戦訓練ではクマ、図書館業務では座学不足が郁を襲う。一方、業務部の同期・柴崎は、問題図書を狙う良化隊の不穏な動きに気付いていた――","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6vlmjybZW3GcWUvoO7LGWQphikM.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5558","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"89742","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81999","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"69721","synopsis":"ライバル・手塚とともに“ライブラリータスクフォース”に配属された郁。野戦訓練ではクマ、図書館業務では座学不足が郁を襲う。一方、業務部の同期・柴崎は、問題図書を狙う良化隊の不穏な動きに気付いていた――","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3M725Hk3fy78vjg2wxxc2Vvs2Lg.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5558","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"89742","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81999","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"69722","synopsis":"小田原攻防戦が終息したのもつかの間、稲嶺基地司令と郁が、良化法賛同団体に拉致された。必死に行方を追う図書隊、そして堂上。郁の機転が功を奏したとき、タスクフォース隊長・玄田が放つ起死回生の一手が光る！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cUKd4WxPZZ00aS8RsgxtJPIWvFn.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5558","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"89742","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81999","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"69723","synopsis":"郁の仕事ぶりを見ようと、両親が図書館にやってくる。戦闘職種配属を隠していた郁は、タスクフォースの面々に泣きつく。危険な仕事に断固反対の母、成長を試すような父。田舎への強制送還を阻止できるか、郁!?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ayw7HAqcDedrALNRmtU6MaWCToA.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5558","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"89742","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81999","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"69725","synopsis":"良化隊がつけ狙う本――『予言書』を回収した郁と小牧。襲撃から逃げるさなか、小牧は、郁と昔の堂上の姿を重ね合わせる。堂上班誕生のエピソード、そして絶体絶命のピンチを切り抜ける小牧の作戦とは。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hhAbMCUURLdavogElfgxewk3Q50.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5558","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"89742","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81999","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"69724","synopsis":"小牧に恋心を抱く、難聴の少女・毬江。彼女の周囲の誤解から、小牧に人権侵害の疑いが掛かる。良化隊に囚われ、厳しい取り調べを受ける小牧。毬江の必死の想いに応え、タスクフォースは救出作戦を決行する！","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/91dwfyz06chGJD5u3aH1F8JCgy2.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5558","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"89742","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81999","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"69727","synopsis":"Kasahara gets interrogated by officials of the LDF's Administration Faction due to Sunagawa's claims. Hikaru thinks that his brother, Satoshi, is influencing the Administrative Faction officials to put pressure on Kasahara and the entire LDF in order for Hikaru to defect to his Library Planning Committee. When Satoshi invites Kasahara for dinner and tells her that the LDF must surrender and disband, she tells him that she would not support his idea, even though he tells her that he would use her as a tool to pressure Hikaru even more. In the end, Dojo comes to see Kasahara despite getting wet in the rain. Due to Dojo's presence and his actions, Satoshi decides to end his interference with the Administration Faction's plans to grill Kasahara further.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iHdCHtPaMWcZxQ1lYdjMzhr8pQu.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5558","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"89742","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81999","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"69726","synopsis":"Kasahara, Shibasaki, and Tezuka participate in the required promotion tests for librarians. During her time spent on studying, Kasahara panics when she thinks about how the one who saved her during her time as a high school student was Dojo himself. This revelation cripples her concentration to study until Dojo assists her by helping her prepare for the test. In the end, she passes the exams with Shibasaki and Tezuka as well. Kasahara gives Dojo some Chamomile essence oil as a means of showing her gratitude before Dojo asks her to take her to the shop where she obtained the oil so as to try some Chamomile tea.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cU6xjaM1jKHgr4JIEwH5NxpUF63.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5558","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"89742","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81999","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"69729","synopsis":"The library task force is sent out to train a peace loving library in Ibaraki Prefecture where there will be a prefectural art exhibition. There, being the first woman in the task force, Kasahara is constantly bullied by others during the mission. They even go as far as calling up Kasahara's mother and informing her of Kasahara's activities. Kasahara and her mother eventually reach an understanding and it is revealed that the reason why Kasahara's mother is so protective is because of an accident when Kasahara fell as a child and hit her head. Kasahara strikes back at the members of the Affairs Department and inspires Defense members to stand up to them as well.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iRLZ1Bb7Soxd9q2T3ijVcOfyHQp.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5558","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"89742","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81999","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"69728","synopsis":"Tezuka gets information from his brother that the Media Betterment Act agents will only fight at the art exhibition for a single day, which helps the Library Corps prepare for the assault. Three hours before the exhibition opens, MBA task force units comes crashing in and the defense force holds them back even after the MBA agents try to storm the barricade with full force. Their aggression forces LDF soldiers and officers to kill them as they would be killed. Shortly after MBA personnel retreat after Kasahara angrily fires at them, a single agent shoots Genda as he stands in front of the piece of art work the Library Corps was defending before unarmed LDF soldiers apprehend the renegade MBA agent. At the same time, the head of the Ibaraki library Commander Sugawara tries to destroy some implicating evidence against her. When Dojo attempts to interfere, he gets shot in the arm and caught in the resulting fire as Kasahara looks on after detaining the head librarian.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yL006WmjLfirKH32BPdzBlbFdHO.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"5558","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"3613","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"89742","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81999","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"69730","synopsis":"Public criticism on the LDF due to the massive MBA casualties begins to grow against the LDF until Kasahara is ambushed by a reporter. Kasahara tells the reporter that the people should not be oppressed due to the MBA and their pro-censorship activities. Due to this, public criticism against the LDF dies down and instead, support grows thanks to pro-LDF media and Tezuka's older brother works in the background to eliminate anti-LDF bias. Dojo is diagnosed with agnosia due to his injuries in the Ibaraki shootout, but later recovers. Inamine decides to step down due to the discovery of radical elements in the MBA that were responsible for undermining the Mito Library Base. Genda has been promoted by the LDF's Administrative Faction as the Kantō LDF base's second commanding officer.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hOKxRO0stNwZ8aWqXaW193OcPkQ.jpg"}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":3613,"malId":3613},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedO